OL,3,GNEWSAPokemon fans queue for hours for
OL,4,A'biggest' card drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have queued through the night
OL,7,Foutside a toy shop to get their hands
OL,8,Fon "the biggest Pokemon drop in 10
OL,9,Fyears".
OL,11,FDan Spragg, from Stroud in
OL,12,FGloucestershire, waited alongside other
OL,13,Ffans ahead of the new release of
OL,14,FPokemon Trading Card Game cards, which
OL,15,Fmarks the franchise's 30th anniversary.
OL,17,FHe and his friends arrived outside
OL,18,FSmyths Toys Superstores in Gloucester
OL,19,Fat 19:00 BST Tuesday, ahead of the
OL,20,Fstore opening at 09:00 Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
