OL,3,GNEWSAPokemon fans queue for hours for
OL,4,A'biggest' card drop
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've been a collector since Pokemon
OL,7,Ffirst came out in 1999, and the
OL,8,Findustry's blown up again. It's that
OL,9,Fnostalgia. It brings back a lot of good
OL,10,Fmemories," Spragg said.
